ἐφ-ίστημι 
[in LXX for נָצַב ni., שִׁית, נָתַן, etc. ;] 
__1. causal in pres., impf., fut., 1 aor., to set upon or by, set up, etc. (Æsch., Hdt., Arist., al). 
__2. Intrans. in mid, and in pf. and 2 aor. act.; 
__(a) to stand upon; 
__(b) to be set over; 
__(with) to stand by, be present, be at hand, come on or upon: Luk.2.38; 10.40; 20.1, Act.6.12; 12.7; 22.13, 20; 23.27, 2Ti.4.2; with dative pars., Luk.2.9; 24.4,…
